// Status: test | Level: high
// Author: Sohan G (D4rkCiph3r)
// Date: 2023-01-31 | Modified: -
// ATT&CK: T1059.002, execution
// Description: Detects potential suspicious run-only executions compiled using OSACompile
// False positives:
//   - Unknown
// References:
//   - https://redcanary.com/blog/applescript/
//   - https://ss64.com/osx/osacompile.html
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/ccbb0369507f796db0b0ae6854c8a2be471b9d84/rules/macos/process_creation/proc_creation_macos_osacompile_runonly_execution.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language 12.4.1, live Defender schema)
// Machine-generated and not tested against real telemetry. Verify before use as a detection.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where ProcessCommandLine contains "osacompile" and ProcessCommandLine contains " -x " and ProcessCommandLine contains " -e "
